{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/947092-need-help-with-a-few-alembics","id":947092,"title":"Need help with a few Alembics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-09T10:58:02-07:00","id":947092,"title":"Need help with a few Alembics","content":"So, from what I gathered, Alembics are supposed to work like a bottle that you fill with pyros. Having an Alembic gives you its Persistent Effect, &quot;pouring&quot; Pyros into an Alembic is a reflexive action, and when you have &quot;poured&quot; enough Pyros in an Alembic you can use its powers.<br /> <br /> Example: Hygeius Alembic<br /> <b>Empty Alembic</b> -&gt; Wound Penalties are now Wound Bonuses<br /> <b>1 pyros poured in</b> -&gt; As previous but can now use an instant action to hide Disfigurements for the scene<br /> <b>2 pyros poured in</b> -&gt; As previous but can now use a reflexive action to ignore physical tilts for the scene<br /> <b>3 pyros poured in</b> -&gt; As previous but can now use a reflexive action to ignore the first 2 damage suffered from any source<br /> <br /> Which is fine and easy to understand.... until they change stuff without clearly explaining them...<br /> <br /> Arc: I can charge Arc as much as I want.... but does &quot;pouring&quot; 3 Pyros into Shock means it's now Divine Lightning? Or a 3-damage Shock?<br /> <br /> Burning Strike (And other similar powers): Cost 3 pyros, keeps active for [Success] turns rather than the scene. If I want to activate it <i>again</i> afterwards, should I spend 3 pyros or 1?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T11:44:19-07:00","id":947128,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnum Opus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/947092-need-help-with-a-few-alembics#post947092\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, from what I gathered, Alembics are supposed to work like a bottle that you fill with pyros. Having an Alembic gives you its Persistent Effect, &quot;pouring&quot; Pyros into an Alembic is a reflexive action, and when you have &quot;poured&quot; enough Pyros in an Alembic you can use its powers.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is correct.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Arc: I can charge Arc as much as I want.... but does &quot;pouring&quot; 3 Pyros into Shock means it's now Divine Lightning? Or a 3-damage Shock? </div> </div> </div>Arc is <i>weird</i>, as per the Alembic description. Both interpretations are actually correct.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Burning Strike (And other similar powers): Cost 3 pyros, keeps active for [Success] turns rather than the scene. If I want to activate it <i>again</i> afterwards, should I spend 3 pyros or 1? </div> </div> </div>If the effect specifies that it ends, the Alembic may or may not be charged. You do not necessarily have to use the powers of the Alembic when you charge it, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">Neall Raemonn Price</span><br /> Beleaguered Scion Developer</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall","name":"Neall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1204"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T11:50:24-07:00","id":947132,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the answers <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/137-neall\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar137_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"137\" data-vbnamecard=\"137\">Neall</a>, but that last one did not really help me. Is there a way for a Promethean to activate Burning Strike more than once a scene?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Glorious Useless-Post Prana<br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Cost: 2</span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">m; </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mins: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Linguistics 1, Essence 1 </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Type: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Simple</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Keywords: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Mute</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Duration: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Instant</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Prerequisite Charms: </span><span style=\"font-family:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-09T13:04:30-07:00","id":947185,"title":"","content":"It was my understanding when reading through the Transmutations that, unless otherwise indicated, the Alembic remains charged for the scene regardless of whether individual Distillations run down. A few specifically outline that they discharge the Alembic, which suggests to me that they normally don't.<br /> <br /> So with Burning Strike, the Distillation only last for (successes) turns, but then you can reroll to power it up again. My reading of Shock indicates that both happen simultaneously. Divine Lightning indicates that (by default) it becomes a 3L bolt of lightning, same as if you pumped three Pyros into the base effect. This lightning also deals damage over an extended period of time, and can be unleashed all around you as well as in a directed bolt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}